\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces \small  \textbf  {The conjectural effective action, visualized.} The faceted object at center is the action; the six phenomena around it are its fields — particle streams (settlement flow $J$), expanding ripples (emission $\varphi $), a warped surface (reputation curvature $g$), a wireframe sphere (global geometry), a violet closed braid (topology $K$), and a three-legged cyan crystal (the post-quantum floor $\Sigma $). Thin orbital curves connect the fields to the center; deliberately, none is drawn as \emph  {derived} from it — which is precisely this paper's epistemic claim. Solid cyan = working mechanism, violet = staged, pale/amber = conjectural theory.}}{9}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
